  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilient Communities in Somalia III (BRCiS III) - NRC Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRCiS III seeks to alleviate humanitarian needs and displacement in Somalia by fortifying the resilience of marginalized rural communities. By targeting local leadership, natural ecosystems, market systems, and humanitarian support, the project aims to diminish vulnerability to shocks and adapt to climate change. Key outcomes include augmented community resilience, enhanced water access, and fortified social capital, with local organizations engaged directly alongside BRCiS Members in implementation endeavors.</narrative>
  </description>
